---
source: tests/cli.rs
expression: "help(&[\"export\", \"wires\", \"--help\"])"
---
The wire list (cut list): one row per conductor — each segment of a multi-endpoint wire — and one per cable screen

Usage: wirebug export wires [OPTIONS] [TARGET]

Arguments:
  [TARGET]  A project manifest, project directory, or `.wb` file. Defaults to the project containing the current directory (found by walking up to `wirebug.toml`)

Options:
      --format <FORMAT>  Table format [default: csv] [possible values: csv, json]
      --out <OUT>        File to write the table to (its directory created if absent), instead of stdout
      --strict           Treat warnings as errors
  -h, --help             Print help
